# A breakpoint on a `.hero` line resolves to a location, is hit, and lldb
# says the file, the line and why the program stopped: the three guards the
# archived test bought with failures (`tests/harness/lldb_session.hero` says
# what each one cost). Built at `-O0`, which carries the debug info for the
# line and for the variables since panel 197.

function area(width: i64, height: i64) -> i64
    product = width * height
    return product

function main()
    print(area(width: 6, height: 7))
